*Spain advanced to play [[Portugal national football team|Portugal]] (runner-up of [[2010 FIFA World Cup Group G|Group G]]) in the [[2010 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Spain vs Portugal|round of 16]].
*Chile advanced to play Brazil (winner of [[2010 FIFA World Cup Group G|Group G]]) in the [[2010 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Brazil vs Chile|round of 16]].
*Switzerland would wind up being the first team since Norway in [[1994 FIFA World Cup|1994]] to defeat the eventual group winner in their opening match but fail to advance to the second round.

